{"logId": "6347383b-b973-43c0-af9c-eb5d2fd4fd87", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [372, 121, 942, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[372.0, 121.0], [942.0, 121.0], [942.0, 165.0], [372.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [365, 232, 562, 263], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[365.0, 232.0], [562.0, 232.0], [562.0, 263.0], [365.0, 263.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、总觉得父母还没有享乐，自己享受生活就亏欠他们", "block_bbox": [389, 290, 1020, 322], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 290.0], [1020.0, 290.0], [1020.0, 322.0], [389.0, 322.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、因彼此观念不同，未顺从父母意愿而背负内心的压力和愧疚", "block_bbox": [388, 335, 1125, 367], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 335.0], [1125.0, 335.0], [1125.0, 367.0], [388.0, 367.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、盲目顺从父母，为了父母意图影响自我选择和规划，造成人生的痛苦，如学业、婚姻、孩子等", "block_bbox": [387, 380, 1518, 412], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[387.0, 380.0], [1518.0, 380.0], [1518.0, 412.0], [387.0, 412.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不尊重父母意愿，强行改变父母喜欢的生活方式", "block_bbox": [389, 425, 994, 457], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 425.0], [994.0, 425.0], [994.0, 457.0], [389.0, 457.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、父母离异，认为是其中一方过错而内心不接受、不原谅、无法释怀", "block_bbox": [389, 470, 1202, 503], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 470.0], [1202.0, 470.0], [1202.0, 503.0], [389.0, 503.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（父母有父母的生活和他们的选择，不合适的感情，放手也是最好的尊重和更多的自由。作为子女，应该用理性的眼光和释怀的态度对待，也站在客观和人性的基础上，引导父母更好地生活，让他们都保持乐观和阳光的状态。）", "block_bbox": [389, 516, 1611, 638], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 516.0], [1611.0, 516.0], [1611.0, 638.0], [389.0, 638.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、没有个人独立的经济能力，需要父母持续性地给予帮助，“啃老族”的状态", "block_bbox": [389, 650, 1308, 683], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 650.0], [1308.0, 650.0], [1308.0, 683.0], [389.0, 683.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、过度依附于父母，事事让父母替自己做决定，“妈宝男/女”的状态", "block_bbox": [389, 695, 1215, 728], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 695.0], [1215.0, 695.0], [1215.0, 728.0], [389.0, 728.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[55]", "block_bbox": [968, 970, 1019, 996], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[968.0, 970.0], [1018.0, 970.0], [1018.0, 995.0], [968.0, 995.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.9006847143173218, "coordinate": [372, 121, 942, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[372.0, 121.0], [942.0, 121.0], [942.0, 165.0], [372.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.819169282913208, "coordinate": [365, 232, 562, 263], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[365.0, 232.0], [562.0, 232.0], [562.0, 263.0], [365.0, 263.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8598964214324951, "coordinate": [389, 290, 1020, 322], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 290.0], [1020.0, 290.0], [1020.0, 322.0